 Entre 2023 y 2025, este organismo adjudicó 37 contratos menores de servicios y suministros de más de 14.000 y hasta 15.000 euros, justo por debajo del límite legal. Si esos importes se repartieran como en la franja inmediatamente inferior, lo esperable serían 10,2 contratos. La razón entre observados y esperados es 3,6, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 2,3 a 5,7. En diciembre se adjudicó el 16 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 19 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 23 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.990 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no implica irregularidades. Puede deberse a factores como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No refleja actos maliciosos ni errores en la adjudicación.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1] y [2] atienden la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas distintas. Analizar si los contratos al límite se distribuyen uniformemente entre los adjudicatarios.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 37 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 10.2 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 3.6, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.3 to 5.7. December accounts for 16% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 19% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 12. Contract [1], for 14,990 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar patterns can occur naturally. The high number of contracts with one awardee does not prove wrongdoing, as multiple needs can justify multiple contracts.\nWhat can be checked: Check if December contracts were for similar services to avoid duplication. Verify if awardee A's contracts were for distinct needs. Review contract [1] to confirm the service aligns with the body's stated objectives.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["SiZgJjF%2FO4RPpzdqOdhuWg%3D%3D","X6abbsV63Vpt5r0ngvMetA%3D%3D","5swtlQnUm23VGIpKDxgsAQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}